   "text": "Queen Mary University of London - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nQueen Mary University of London - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nQueen Mary is one of the UK’s leading research-focused higher education institutions. With around 26,000 students and 4,500 staff, it is one of the largest University of London colleges. Queen Mary teaches and researches across a wide range of subjects in the humanities, social sciences, law, medicine and dentistry, and science and engineering. A member of the prestigious Russell Group of universities, it is one of the world’s most culturally diverse institutions with a student body representing over 160 nationalities. It was ranked in the Top 20 in the world for International Outlook (THE 2020).\nPathways offer International students subject-specific preparation for undergraduate degree study at Queen Mary University of London and other UK universities. When students successfully complete the foundation year, they will progress onto one of more than 100 undergraduate degrees.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:37\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:32\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £25,320.00\nMin: £17,490.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n2,970 of 27,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1785\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IBt7Is0noh4\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
