   "text": "Queen Mary University of London - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nQueen Mary University of London - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nList of Testimonials\nSearch Institution Testimonials\nSEARCH\nMANAGE FILTERS\nREFRESH\n2 items available\nSorted by {0} descending\nColumn headers with buttons are sortable\nImage\n\t\nStudent Name\n\t\nComment\n\t\nCreated\n\t\nLisa McGinty\nPhD student graduating in 2018\n\t\n\"Throughout my PhD I have had the opportunity to present my work at both national and international conferences as well as internally organised events such as the Blizard Institute symposium and our graduate studies day.    I thoroughly enjoy working....Show More\n\t\nNov 23, 2020\nData Migration\n\t\nHannah Thompson\nPhD student graduating in 2017\n\t\n\"I chose to study my PhD at QMUL for various reasons mainly because of its attachment to major UK hospitals which I use for patient samples. The university has range of large research intensive institutes including the world-renowned Blizard Institut....Show More\n\t\nNov 23, 2020\nData Migration",
